which event do the official v2.0.0 onsets mark?

1. inter-onset intervals, official vs PsychToolbox triggers (within run, no clock)
   subject     n  |dIOI| T1  |dIOI| T2  |dIOI| T3  T3-T2 sd  T3-T1 sd   (median abs difference, s)
